[I] Ogg Opus tags editor

[T] opustags views and edits the comments of Ogg Opus files, interactively
[T] in a text editor, with command line flags or via export and import of
[T] text files. It is designed to be fast and conservative, preserving the
[T] original file bit for bit apart from the tags.

[U] https://github.com/fmang/opustags

[A] Opustags Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

